Orbify: offer only this firmware's own releases (tags xteink-v<version>) from a repo whose
"latest" release is Android: read the release list, keep the newest tag with the prefix
(CROSSINK_OTA_TAG_PREFIX), skip pre-releases unless asked for, and keep 48-byte tags.
